NOTE ON AUDIO
This licence covers the software only. The Creative-Commons audio recordings
embedded in index.html are NOT covered by it. All thirteen are CC0 or CC BY, so
all permit commercial use, but the six CC BY items require attribution — see
NOTICE.md and audio/manifest.json. An earlier build contained three CC BY-NC 4.0
clips; these were replaced and the shipped build contains none.